#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:2 f2c5431906e640e5adf470cb6004f1eb
msgid "_`CMakeLists Configuration`"
msgstr "CMakeLists 配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:5 b85a07349e904f498fc78c8e99948d5d
msgid "_`Overview`"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:7 c7adfa234b5c4261a9d1aab25a78d472
msgid ""
"The CMakeLists.txt file is the build entry point of food_volume_measure. "
"It reads the package identity and every build switch from metadata.json, "
"collects the sources from include and src, and creates the library "
"targets together with their installation rules."
msgstr ""
"CMakeLists.txt 文件是 food_volume_measure 的构建入口。它从 metadata.json "
"读取包标识与各项构建开关，从 include 与 src 收集源文件，并创建库目标及其安装规则。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:10 d18cd4652caf4059b8ca24b01c0adc52
msgid "_`Key Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:12 ed64ce1d90dc42f59f010e562650070b
msgid "Package identity and build switches parsed from metadata.json"
msgstr "从 metadata.json 解析包标识与构建开关"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:13 2eeaf81ef6f5446a86df252c3d49f7f0
msgid "Automatic source collection and target creation"
msgstr "自动收集源文件并创建目标"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:14 e755aed46abb4153a2f96d80b68ceade
msgid ""
"Dependency wiring through the C_DEPS / CPP_DEPS lists prepared by the "
"Conan recipe"
msgstr "通过 Conan 配方准备好的 C_DEPS / CPP_DEPS 列表接入依赖"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:15 df4c2554c9174fbd899759a4e213930b
msgid "Optional C++ module support (C++23 and above)"
msgstr "可选的 C++ 模块支持（C++23 及以上）"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:16 4558d7c80ce1488b9f4a38d61aacf8d2
msgid "Optional Python bindings module"
msgstr "可选的 Python 绑定模块"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:17 3fadf09c63844986bc2a9c2947c4ec70
msgid "Installation rules for libraries, headers and the CMake package export"
msgstr "库、头文件与 CMake 包导出的安装规则"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:20 2fc08dd2da7b4533b95893841a2c0608
msgid "_`Main Configurations`"
msgstr "主要配置项"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:22 5e84c94a14b344638858910e298da51a
msgid ""
"Build switches are read from metadata.json rather than being hard-coded: "
"project name, namespace and version, the C and C++ standards, shared or "
"static, header-only mode, the pre-compiled standard modules list, code "
"coverage and the Python bindings switch."
msgstr ""
"构建开关从 metadata.json 读取而非硬编码：项目名、命名空间与版本，C 与 C++ "
"标准，静态或共享，仅头文件模式，预编译标准模块列表，代码覆盖率以及 Python 绑定开关。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:24 393122b2bb0d4a808c7ad9192a43882e
msgid ""
"Sources are collected recursively from include (\\*.h, \\*.hpp) and src "
"(\\*.c, \\*.cpp and the module suffixes \\*.ixx / \\*.cppm). Every glob "
"is anchored to its own directory, so the scan does not pick up api, "
"test_package, benchmark or build."
msgstr ""
"源文件从 include（\\*.h、\\*.hpp）与 src（\\*.c、\\*.cpp 以及模块后缀 \\*.ixx / "
"\\*.cppm）递归收集。每个 glob 都锚定到自身目录，因此扫描不会误收 api、test_package、benchmark 或 "
"build。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:26 4f4a46cb785f4b338b0d0042dcf88db9
msgid ""
"For a general package the configuration creates food_volume_measure_c and"
" food_volume_measure_cpp and an INTERFACE target that links both, so a "
"consumer only has to link food_volume_measure. The standards are applied "
"per target - C11 and C++17 for this library - with compiler extensions "
"disabled. Because add_library() rejects an empty source list, a generated"
" empty translation unit keeps the C target valid even though this library"
" currently has no C sources. On Windows a requested shared build is "
"downgraded to static with a warning."
msgstr ""
"对于普通包，该配置创建 food_volume_measure_c 与 food_volume_measure_cpp，以及一个同时链接二者的 "
"INTERFACE 目标，因此使用者只需链接 food_volume_measure。标准按目标设置——本库为 C11 与 "
"C++17——并关闭编译器扩展。由于 add_library() 不接受空的源文件列表，一个自动生成的空编译单元让 C "
"目标保持有效，即使本库当前没有 C 源文件。在 Windows 上，请求共享构建会被降级为静态构建并给出警告。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:28 c61b54dc3f89477694388e0da3720d97
msgid ""
"Dependencies arrive from the Conan recipe as Pkg@Targets pairs; the "
"configuration splits each pair, calls find_package() and links the listed"
" targets into the C or the C++ library."
msgstr ""
"依赖以 Pkg@Targets 形式来自 Conan 配方；该配置拆分每一对，调用 find_package() 并把列出的目标链接进 C 或 "
"C++ 库。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:30 94e991ee4ce54469b26cc5f58cac2653
msgid ""
"C++ modules are only activated for C++23 and above, and below that the "
"build reports that module support is disabled. Platform-specific module "
"handling covers MSVC (.ixx) and GCC/Clang (.cppm). When the Python "
"bindings switch is on, an additional pybind11 module is built from "
"api/python_bindings.cpp and installed next to the libraries."
msgstr ""
"C++ 模块仅在 C++23 及以上启用，低于该标准时构建会报告模块支持已关闭。平台相关的模块处理覆盖 MSVC（.ixx）与 "
"GCC/Clang（.cppm）。当 Python 绑定开关打开时，会额外从 api/python_bindings.cpp 构建一个 "
"pybind11 模块，并与库一起安装。"

